The adapted implementation provides standalone failable parsing, strict ASCII
identifier validation, canonical core and numeric prerelease validation,
overflow-safe numeric prerelease ordering, Hashable and string Codable support.
Version precedence follows SwiftPM, including equality that ignores build metadata.
